\details{
The multivariate Gaussian (\code{MVG}) family models category structure over
\eqn{D}-dimensional continuous cue spaces with correlated cue dimensions:
\deqn{p(\mathbf{x} \mid c) = \mathcal{N}(\mathbf{x}; \boldsymbol{\mu}_c,
\mathbf{\Sigma}_c)}
}
